    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d92">

                <pb facs="0310" n="224" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v1/pg224"/>

                <head>No. 90.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wing to Mr. Fish</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United
                                States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Quito,
                                Ecuador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-01-29"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 29, 1873</date>.
                        (Received March 5.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 278.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my dispatch No. 276,1 have the
                    honor of forwarding, per this mail, two copies of El Nacional, of this city, of
                    January 17 and 20, respectively, containing a report from the explorer, Dr.
                    Reiss, to the president of this republic.</p>
                <p>I also append hereto a translation thereof, which has been very hastily made, and
                    may be a little faulty in a few points.</p>
                <p>* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>E. RUMSEY WING.</signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d92-a1.xml" xpointer="d92-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
